{"id":"258c57f3152fa88d","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ATR0-equivalences.md","title":"ATR0, Well Order Comparison and Sigma-One-One Separation","display":"thm-ATR0-equivalences — ATR0, Well Order Comparison and Sigma-One-One Separation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ATR0-equivalences","aliases":["62-thm-ATR0-equivalences"],"display":"thm-ATR0-equivalences — ATR0, Well Order Comparison and Sigma-One-One Separation","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-ATR0]]","[[62-df-WellOrder]]","[[62-df-order-comparison]]","[[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma V.2.9; Theorems V.5.1, V.6.8","source_pages":[177,190,198],"source_pdf_pages":[195,208,216]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ATR0-equivalences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ATR0-equivalences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ATR0-equivalences — ATR0, Well Order Comparison and Sigma-One-One Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"426b1e91662e3168\" href=\"?note=426b1e91662e3168\" title=\"62-df-order-comparison\">62-df-order-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a2aa75ce7e4d78f\" href=\"?note=7a2aa75ce7e4d78f\" title=\"62-df-Sigma11-separation\">62-df-Sigma11-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma V.2.9; Theorems V.5.1, V.6.8"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>177</span><span>190</span><span>198</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span><span>208</span><span>216</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a>；WO 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"426b1e91662e3168\" href=\"?note=426b1e91662e3168\" title=\"62-df-order-comparison\">62-df-order-comparison</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"7a2aa75ce7e4d78f\" href=\"?note=7a2aa75ce7e4d78f\" title=\"62-df-Sigma11-separation\">62-df-Sigma11-separation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWO}\">\\(\\mathrm{CWO}\\)</span> 在下式引入。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\)</span>，序谓词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ATR0\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{CWO}\\coloneqq\\forall W,R,V,S[(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\land\\mathrm{WO}(V,S))\\to((W,R)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(V,S)\\lor(V,S)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(W,R))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ATR0\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{CWO}\\coloneqq\\forall W,R,V,S[(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\land\\mathrm{WO}(V,S))\\to((W,R)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(V,S)\\lor(V,S)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(W,R))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CWO}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2);\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CWO}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2);\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>V.2.9 以超限递归构造比较映射；V.6.8 的反向先从 CWO 恢复算术理解，再用原文的良序和、积与统一比较界，对两套编码不交 Σ¹₁ 类的序列构造比较标志，得到 Σ¹₁ 分离。V.5.1 的反向利用递归层级在各初始段的唯一性，以分离集合拼合完整 H；正向以良序化的树搜索进行分离。书中反射单关系序码与本目录严格双集合序码可在 RCA₀ 转换。这里列出实际非平凡等价，不以“ATR 公理表包含 ATR”替代反向数学。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma V.2.9; Theorems V.5.1, V.6.8；纸面页 177, 190, 198；PDF 页 195, 208, 216。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WellOrder","status":"resolved","id":"649faa9c6d69237b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WellOrder]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-order-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"426b1e91662e3168","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-order-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Sigma11-separation","status":"resolved","id":"7a2aa75ce7e4d78f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；WO 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}$ 见 [[62-df-order-comparison]]，$\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{CWO}$ 在下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hyp